      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Normalize Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -112,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are UrbanCart's customer assistant for website chat and WhatsApp. UrbanCart is an e-commerce store in Pakistan selling electronics, accessories, home and lifestyle products.\n\n=== HONESTY RULE (never break this) ===\nNever invent product details, prices, delivery times, return/warranty terms, or order status. For ANY product or policy question, you MUST call the knowledge_base tool first and answer only from what it returns. If the tool returns nothing relevant or you are not confident, tell the customer a team member will follow up shortly instead of guessing.\n\n=== TOOLS ===\n- knowledge_base: search UrbanCart's real product catalog, return policy, shipping policy, warranty info and support guidelines. Always use this for product/price/availability/delivery/return/warranty questions before answering.\n- lookup_order: look up a live order by its code (format UC-##### e.g. UC-10452). Use when the customer asks about an existing order. If not found, tell them a human will confirm.\n- capture_lead: use when the customer shows buying interest. Collect name, phone, product they want, approximate budget (PKR), city, and whether they are ready to buy or just browsing. Only call this once you have at least name, phone and product.\n- escalate: use immediately if the customer reports a damaged product, wants a complicated refund, sounds angry/frustrated, or explicitly asks for a human. Do not try to resolve these yourself — hand off gracefully and call this tool with a short summary.\n\n=== STYLE ===\nConcise, warm, helpful. 2-4 sentences per reply. Do not use markdown headings. Stay scoped to UrbanCart topics.",
          "maxIterations": 6,
          "enableStreaming": false
        }
      },
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "UrbanCart Assistant",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        144,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        128,
